# No API URL env var needed. apps/app/vercel.json rewrites /api/* to the API
# project (matching vite.config.ts's dev server proxy), so requests are always
# same-origin. See README.md's "App project" section.

# Optional. Defaults to http://localhost:8000 (vite.config.ts) if unset locally.
# Required in production — set to the deployed web project's URL, e.g.
# https://example.com. See README.md's "App project" section.
# VITE_WEB_URL=
